      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T22:45:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can these be combined? Maybe with a routine that processes an array populated with `EXTRA_TASK_COUNT` items?\n\nIt may not be worth the complication, unless we think there might be other items that we add to the extra tasks.\n\nIf it\u0027s too messy, at least put a comment in shimmed_task_id() indicating that `task_get_current()` should be updated for additions/deletions to the extra tasks.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 115,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 124,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "76dbe5cb7cdb41fbb89d5ba3f9269e4594076f0c",
